{"path":"io/c/putchar","title":"std::putchar","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>putchar","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/c/putchar","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Writes a character ch to stdout. Internally, the character is converted to unsigned char just before being written.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cstdio\">&lt;cstdio&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> putchar<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> ch <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Writes a character <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ch</span></code> to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stdout</a></span>. Internally, the character is converted to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span></code> just before being written.\n</p><p>Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fputc\"><span class=\"kw1842\">std::<span class=\"me2\">putc</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ch, <span class=\"kw2\">stdout</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ch\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> character to be written\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>On success, returns the written character.\n</p><p>On failure, returns <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c\">EOF</a></span> and sets the <i>error</i> indicator (see <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/ferror\">std::ferror()</a></span>) on <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stdout</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdio&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span> c <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">'a'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> c <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">'z'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">putchar</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// putchar return value is not equal to the argument</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> r <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu12\">0x1024</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw1861\">std::<span class=\"me2\">printf</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>r = 0x%x<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, r<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    r <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">putchar</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>r<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw1861\">std::<span class=\"me2\">printf</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>r = 0x%x<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, r<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxy\nr = 0x1024\n$\nr = 0x24</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fputc\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fputc</span><span>putc</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  writes a character to a file stream <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/io/putchar\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>putchar</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/c","title":"C-style file input/output"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::putchar","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Writes a character ch to stdout. Internally, the character is converted to unsigned char just before being written."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"ch"},{"label":"Return value","note":"On success, returns the written character."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"fputc, putc","note":"writes a character to a file stream"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":126,"codeBlockCount":2}
